                        <ul>
                            <li><span>We practice integrated thematic study which aims at enhancing development and education of children through play.</span></li>
                            <li><span>Our specially designed curriculum encourages children to develop self- confidence and self -esteem to feel valued as individuals.</span></li>
                            <li><span>Circle time is a great time for children to learn social skills of being together as a large group and to learn more about the theme</span></li>
